{"text":"kuruntokai","n":235,"lines":["ஓம்புமதி வாழியோ வாடை பாம்பின்","தூங்குதோல் கடுக்குந் தூவெள் ளருவிக்","கல்லுயர் நண்ணி யதுவே நெல்லி","மரையின மாரு முன்றிற்","புல்வேய் குரம்பை நல்லோ ளூரே"],"tr":["ōmpumati vāḻiyō vāṭai pāmpiṉ","tūṅkutōl kaṭukkun tūveḷ ḷaruvik","kalluyar naṇṇi yatuvē nelli","maraiyiṉa māru muṉṟiṟ","pulvēy kurampai nallō ḷūrē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"மரயேண்டனார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Marayēṇṭaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 8"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஓம்புமதி","tr":"ōmpumati","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஓம்","tr":"ōm"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பும","tr":"puma"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தி","tr":"ti"}]},{"text":"வாழியோ","tr":"vāḻiyō","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியோ","tr":"ḻiyō"}]},{"text":"வாடை","tr":"vāṭai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டை","tr":"ṭai"}]},{"text":"பாம்பின்","tr":"pāmpiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பாம்","tr":"pām"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பின்","tr":"piṉ"}]}],[{"text":"தூங்குதோல்","tr":"tūṅkutōl","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூங்","tr":"tūṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குதோல்","tr":"kutōl"}]},{"text":"கடுக்குந்","tr":"kaṭukkun","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடுக்","tr":"kaṭuk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குந்","tr":"kun"}]},{"text":"தூவெள்","tr":"tūveḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூ","tr":"tū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வெள்","tr":"veḷ"}]},{"text":"ளருவிக்","tr":"ḷaruvik","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ளரு","tr":"ḷaru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"விக்","tr":"vik"}]}],[{"text":"கல்லுயர்","tr":"kalluyar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கல்","tr":"kal"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"லுயர்","tr":"luyar"}]},{"text":"நண்ணி","tr":"naṇṇi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நண்","tr":"naṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணி","tr":"ṇi"}]},{"text":"யதுவே","tr":"yatuvē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"யது","tr":"yatu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]},{"text":"நெல்லி","tr":"nelli","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெல்","tr":"nel"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லி","tr":"li"}]}],[{"text":"மரையின","tr":"maraiyiṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மரை","tr":"marai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யின","tr":"yiṉa"}]},{"text":"மாரு","tr":"māru","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரு","tr":"ru"}]},{"text":"முன்றிற்","tr":"muṉṟiṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முன்","tr":"muṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றிற்","tr":"ṟiṟ"}]}],[{"text":"புல்வேய்","tr":"pulvēy","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புல்","tr":"pul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேய்","tr":"vēy"}]},{"text":"குரம்பை","tr":"kurampai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குரம்","tr":"kuram"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பை","tr":"pai"}]},{"text":"நல்லோ","tr":"nallō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோ","tr":"lō"}]},{"text":"ளூரே","tr":"ḷūrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளூ","tr":"ḷū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஓம்புமதி","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்பு","lemma":"ஓம்பு","gloss":"protect/spare"},{"text":"மதி","lemma":"மதி","gloss":"honorific imperative suffix"}],"gloss":"please spare"},{"surface":"வாழியோ","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழி","gloss":"may you live"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"clitic particle"}],"gloss":"may you prosper"},{"surface":"வாடை","parts":[{"text":"வாடை","lemma":"வாடை","gloss":"north wind"}],"gloss":"O north wind"},{"surface":"பாம்பின்","parts":[{"text":"பாம்பு","lemma":"பாம்பு","gloss":"snake"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"oblique/comparative suffix"}],"gloss":"like a snake's"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தூங்குதோல்","parts":[{"text":"தூங்கு","lemma":"தூங்கு","gloss":"hanging/sloughed"},{"text":"தோல்","lemma":"தோல்","gloss":"skin"}],"gloss":"sloughed skin"},{"surface":"கடுக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"கடுக்கும்","lemma":"கடு","gloss":"resembling"}],"gloss":"resembling"},{"surface":"தூவெள்","parts":[{"text":"தூ","lemma":"தூ","gloss":"pure"},{"text":"வெள்","lemma":"வெள்","gloss":"white"}],"gloss":"pure white"},{"surface":"அருவி","parts":[{"text":"அருவி","lemma":"அருவி","gloss":"waterfall"}],"gloss":"waterfall"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கல்லுயர்","parts":[{"text":"கல்","lemma":"கல்","gloss":"stone/mountain"},{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"உயர்","gloss":"high"}],"gloss":"high mountain"},{"surface":"நண்ணியதுவே","parts":[{"text":"நண்ணியது","lemma":"நண்ணு","gloss":"situated near"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"is situated near"},{"surface":"நெல்லி","parts":[{"text":"நெல்லி","lemma":"நெல்லி","gloss":"amla tree"}],"gloss":"amla tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மரையினம்","parts":[{"text":"மரை","lemma":"மரை","gloss":"wild cow"},{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"இனம்","gloss":"herd"}],"gloss":"herd of wild cows"},{"surface":"ஆரும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆரும்","lemma":"ஆர்","gloss":"grazing/eating"}],"gloss":"grazing"},{"surface":"முன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"முன்றில்","lemma":"முன்றில்","gloss":"courtyard"}],"gloss":"courtyard"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புல்வேய்","parts":[{"text":"புல்","lemma":"புல்","gloss":"grass"},{"text":"வேய்","lemma":"வேய்","gloss":"thatched"}],"gloss":"grass-thatched"},{"surface":"குரம்பை","parts":[{"text":"குரம்பை","lemma":"குரம்பை","gloss":"hut"}],"gloss":"hut"},{"surface":"நல்லோள்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"},{"text":"ஓள்","lemma":"ஓள்","gloss":"woman"}],"gloss":"good woman"},{"surface":"ஊரே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town/village"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"is the town"}]}],"literal":"Please spare, may you live, O north wind! Like a snake's / hanging sloughed skin resembling, pure white waterfall's / high mountain situated near, that very amla tree's / herd of wild cows grazing courtyard / grass-thatched hut, of the good woman's town.","translation":"May you prosper, O north wind! Please spare the town of my beloved, she of the grass-thatched hut with a courtyard where herds of wild cows graze on amla fruits, situated near the high mountain where a pure white waterfall cascades, resembling the sloughed skin of a snake.","modern":"வடகாற்றே! நீ வாழ்க! பாம்பின் சட்டை போன்ற தூய வெள்ளை அருவிகள் விழும் உயர்ந்த மலையின் அருகில் உள்ளது நெல்லி மரங்கள் நிறைந்த பகுதி. அங்குள்ள முற்றத்தில் காட்டுப் பசுக்கள் நெல்லிக்காய்களை மேயும். அத்தகைய புல்லால் வேயப்பட்ட குடிலைக் கொண்ட என் நல்லவளின் ஊரை நீ வருத்தாமல் காப்பாயாக.","explanation":"This poem is set in the pālai (wasteland/separation) landscape, spoken by the hero who is traveling away from his beloved. He addresses the chilly north wind, which intensifies the pain of separation for lovers. He begs the wind to be gentle and spare his beloved's humble village from its freezing blast. Her village is described as having grass-thatched huts where herds of wild cows graze on fallen amla fruits in the courtyards. This peaceful settlement is nestled near a high mountain featuring a pure white waterfall that resembles a discarded snake skin. Through these vivid natural images, the hero expresses his deep love and anxiety for his beloved's well-being during the cold season.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}